      <t indent="0" pn="section-5-1">Lars Eggert is partly funded by <xref target="TRILOGY" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="TRILOGY"/>, a research project
supported by the European Commission under its Seventh Framework
Program.</t>
    </section>
